  (text "Reactor TIA  -  2 channels, one op-amp each  (BPW34 -> OPA380 TIA)" (at 40 34 0) (effects (font (size 2.6 2.6)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000318))
  (text "One op-amp per channel = TIA only, no 2nd-stage filter.  R_f -> ~3 V pedestal;  C_f -> ~1.6 kHz pole." (at 42 44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000319))
  (text "Anti-alias handled by AD7606 oversampling.  CH2 = matched: ratiometric reference PD (drift cancel) or a 2nd plane." (at 42 49 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000320))
  (text "Channel 1" (at 26 86 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000321))
  (text "Channel 2" (at 26 134 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000322))
  (text "VBIAS divider  (0.45 V)  -  shared by both channels" (at 40 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000323))
  (text "decoupling  (100 nF / amp + 10 uF + 1 uF bulk)" (at 104 156 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000324))
  (text "4x 2N7000 low-side laser drivers  -  green/red/infrared/blue" (at 226 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000325))
  (text "Each GPIO path: input -> 330R series gate resistor -> 2N7000 gate, with 100k pulldown at the gate." (at 226 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000326))
  (text "J3 = Pi GPIO control.  J4 = laser module outputs.  J5 = current-limited laser supply + common ground." (at 226 39 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000327))
  (text "Do not route laser switching return through the TIA summing-node area; star back to common ground." (at 226 44 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000328))
  (text "D1, D2 / Q1-Q4 / J1-J5 = hand-add (THT)" (at 168 132 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid a1b2c3d4-2c00-4000-8000-000000000329))
